WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.680
One, two, three, four.

00:02.680 --> 00:04.420
That's a bar.

00:04.420 --> 00:06.020
What goes in it?

00:06.020 --> 00:08.060
Let's find out.

00:08.060 --> 00:11.880
Pip rings the bell and lets it go,

00:11.880 --> 00:15.640
it hums the whole way through, so slow.

00:16.000 --> 00:17.820
One, two, three, four,

00:17.820 --> 00:20.240
and then it's done.

00:20.240 --> 00:22.100
Fill the bar, fill the bar,

00:22.100 --> 00:24.040
four beats long from end to end.

00:24.040 --> 00:25.980
Long notes, short notes, quiet rests,

00:25.980 --> 00:27.700
every bar is one whole, friend.

00:27.700 --> 00:30.040
Fill the bar, fill the bar,

00:30.040 --> 00:31.740
make it full and make it ring.

00:31.740 --> 00:33.780
When there's no more room to fill,

00:33.780 --> 00:36.220
that's the moment that we sing!

00:36.220 --> 00:37.840
Dot taps once and holds it, two,

00:37.840 --> 00:39.800
then taps again and holds it too.

00:39.800 --> 00:42.040
Half a bar, then half a bar:

00:42.040 --> 00:43.960
two halves make one whole. There you are.

00:43.960 --> 00:46.360
The mending crew begin to hammer,

00:46.360 --> 00:48.480
they never stop and never stammer.

00:48.480 --> 00:50.860
Tap, tap, tap, tap.

00:50.860 --> 00:51.700
Tap, tap, tap, tap.

00:51.700 --> 00:53.880
One beat each, and four in all:

00:53.880 --> 00:55.840
four quarters fill it, wall to wall.

00:55.840 --> 00:57.840
Fill the bar, fill the bar,

00:57.840 --> 00:59.820
four beats long from end to end.

00:59.820 --> 01:01.760
Long notes, short notes, quiet rests,

01:01.760 --> 01:03.720
every bar is one whole, friend.

01:03.720 --> 01:05.880
Fill the bar, fill the bar,

01:05.880 --> 01:07.760
make it full and make it ring.

01:07.760 --> 01:09.720
When there's no more room to fill,

01:09.720 --> 01:12.640
that's the moment that we sing!

01:12.640 --> 01:13.820
Bramble's magpie hops in fast,

01:13.820 --> 01:15.760
two little hops in every beat.

01:15.760 --> 01:17.780
Eight quick eighths, and not one more,

01:17.780 --> 01:19.800
and the bar is full and neat.

01:19.800 --> 01:22.240
Shh. A rest is quiet, but a rest still counts.

01:22.240 --> 01:23.980
It takes up room, the same amount.

01:24.160 --> 01:26.140
A quarter rest, a beat of air,

01:26.140 --> 01:28.380
the bar keeps time while nothing's there.

01:28.380 --> 01:30.100
Tap, tap, tap.

01:30.100 --> 01:31.980
Tap, tap, tap.

01:31.980 --> 01:34.400
Now a half, and then a quarter,

01:34.400 --> 01:36.280
then two eighths to fill the last.

01:36.280 --> 01:38.380
Long, then shorter, then the shortest:

01:38.380 --> 01:39.920
one whole bar, from slow to fast.

01:39.920 --> 01:42.080
Fill the bar, fill the bar,

01:42.080 --> 01:43.820
four beats long from end to end.

01:43.820 --> 01:45.780
Long notes, short notes, quiet rests,

01:45.780 --> 01:47.760
every bar is one whole, friend.

01:47.760 --> 01:49.840
Fill the bar, fill the bar,

01:49.840 --> 01:51.720
make it full and make it ring.

01:51.720 --> 01:53.720
When there's no more room to fill,

01:53.720 --> 01:55.860
that's the moment that we sing!

01:55.860 --> 01:57.720
Your turn.

01:57.720 --> 01:59.980
Fill a bar!
